AVE_ITEM` event dispatched from the local website. This includes a handler.\n\nThe `background.js` file is configured to process the message received from `content.js`, facilitating the storage and retrieval of the synced information. The `background.js` script will handle the `SYNC_FROM_LOCALHOST` message.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\vijay\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\offline-vault-extension\\\\content.js\"","EndLine":"230","StartLine":"190","toolAction":"\"Viewing bottom of content.js\"","toolSummary":"\"View end of content.js\""}}],"truncated_fields":["thinking"]}
